 "text": "Skip to Main Content\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205\n\nAbout Us\nContact\nFAQ's\nYour Trip\nTravel Info\nBlog\nAbout Mazingira\n\nWelcome to Mazingira Safaris, where your journey into the heart of Tanzania begins! At Mazingira Safaris, we specialize in creating unforgettable safari experiences that immerse you in the stunning landscapes and diverse wildlife of one of Africa's most breathtaking destinations. Our name, 'Mazingira,' means 'environment' in Swahili, reflecting our commitment to sustainable tourism and conservation efforts that protect the natural beauty and species of Tanzania.\n\nOur Story\n\nFounded by local experts with decades of experience, Mazingira Safaris is passionate about sharing the wonder of Tanzania’s ecosystems, culture, and wildlife. We offer a wide range of safari options, from luxury tours to customized excursions, ensuring that every traveler finds their perfect adventure. Our knowledgeable guides, all native to Tanzania, bring authenticity and deep insight to your safari experience, enhancing your understanding and appreciation of the natural world.Our mission is not just to show you Tanzania, but to create a profound connection between our guests and the landscapes we explore. We believe in responsible tourism that supports local communities and contributes to the preservation of wildlife and natural habitats. Join us at Mazingira Safaris for a truly memorable and impactful adventure in the wilds of Tanzania.\n\nWhy Choose Us ?\n\n\nChoose Mazingira Safaris for an unforgettable, tailor-made safari experience in Tanzania. Every package we offer is custom-built to meet the unique preferences and needs of our customers, ensuring a personalized adventure like no other. With a local Tanzanian at the helm who boasts over 15 years of industry experience, we bring deep, authentic insights and a personal touch to your journey. Our commitment to excellence is reflected in our outstanding 5-star reviews. Plus, as a member of the Tanzania Association of Tour Operators (TATO), we provide added peace of mind, ensuring that your safari is not only spectacular but also secure and reliable. Choose Mazingira Safaris for a truly exceptional exploration of Tanzania’s natural wonders.\n\nRely on us to arrange anything you need. We will withstand a great standard of quality\n\nOur Passionate local Guides, have an incredible set of skills and knowledge to share with you.\n\nGenuine Tanzanian Hospitality. Our team can not wait to plan you perfect safari and welcome you to Tanzania\n\nIncredible 5 Star Reviews from out incredible customers\n\nOur Partners\nContact us\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\nuk.sales@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205 / +255767278204\n\nAccessibility Statement \n\nMazingira Eco Friendly Safari Adventure\n\nArusha \n\nP.O Box 12544\n\nStay informed, join our newsletter\n\nEnter your email here \nSubscribe\n\nMazingira Safari © 2023 | ",
